<title>USA: ADFlex names vp of finance as interim CFO.</title>
<headline>ADFlex names vp of finance as interim CFO.</headline>
<dateline>CHANDLER, Ariz. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>ADFlex Solutions Inc said Wednesday it had named Margaret Sleeper, its vice president of finance and accounting, as interim chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Former CFO Dale Bartos has accepted a position with a manufacturing company in Southern California, it said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
